Ticket: OPS-77 "The sessions table is growing again, add a cleanup job"

Repository history (what the reviewer can see):

$ git log --oneline -- deploy/k8s/
2b7f4e1 k8s: delete cleanup-cron; it raced the nightly archiver and purged unarchived rows (INC-2023-02). Cleanup now runs inside the archiver.
5a0c3d8 k8s: add cleanup-cron (hourly)

diff --git a/deploy/k8s/cleanup-cron.yaml b/deploy/k8s/cleanup-cron.yaml
--- /dev/null
+++ b/deploy/k8s/cleanup-cron.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+apiVersion: batch/v1
+kind: CronJob
+metadata:
+  name: cleanup
+  namespace: core
+spec:
+  schedule: "0 * * * *"
+  jobTemplate:
+    spec:
+      template:
+        spec:
+          restartPolicy: OnFailure
+          containers:
+            - name: cleanup
+              image: registry.example.com/core/tools:2.9.0
+              args: ["cleanup", "--table", "sessions", "--older-than", "7d"]
+              resources:
+                limits: { cpu: 500m, memory: 256Mi }
